{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q64017479","formula":"C₁₄H₁₉NO₁₀S₂","hill":"C14H19NO10S2","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":14.0,"H":19.0,"N":1.0,"O":10.0,"S":2.0},"names":{"en":"Sinalbin","ru":"Синальбин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Sinalbin is a glucosinolate found in the seeds of white mustard, Sinapis alba, and in many wild plant species. In contrast to mustard from black mustard (Brassica nigra) seeds which contain sinigrin, mustard from white mustard seeds has only a weakly pungent taste. Sinalbin is metabolised to form the mustard oil 4-hydroxybenzyl isothiocyanate by the enzyme myrosinase.","ru":"Синальби́н — гликозид, находящийся в семенах белой горчицы (лат. Sinapis alba) и других дикорастущих видах. В отличие от чёрной горчицы (Brassica nigra), семена которой содержат синигрин, продукт из семян белой горчицы имеет слабо острый вкус."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":656568,"mass":425.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC(=CC=C1CC(=NOS(=O)(=O)O)S[C@H]2[C@@H]([C@H]([C@@H]([C@H](O2)CO)O)O)O)O","inchikey":"WWBNBPSEKLOHJU-LPUQOGTASA-N","iupac":"[(2S,3R,4S,5S,6R)-3,4,5-trihydroxy-6-(hydroxymethyl)oxan-2-yl] 2-(4-hydroxyphenyl)-N-sulfooxyethanimidothioate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"656568","atoms":46,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.738,"y":-0.111,"z":2.337,"el":"S"},{"x":-1.545,"y":3.514,"z":-0.548,"el":"S"},{"x":1.43,"y":-0.425,"z":-0.226,"el":"O"},{"x":5.393,"y":-1.254,"z":0.481,"el":"O"},{"x":4.495,"y":-0.565,"z":-2.22,"el":"O"},{"x":3.851,"y":0.155,"z":2.472,"el":"O"},{"x":0.33,"y":-0.052,"z":-2.714,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.741,"y":2.247,"z":0.463,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.918,"y":-3.787,"z":-1.443,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.073,"y":3.846,"z":-1.007,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.824,"y":3.056,"z":-1.721,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.062,"y":4.643,"z":0.223,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.513,"y":1.716,